# Any OpenAI-compatible server works. Defaults below are for FastFlowLM (`flm serve <model>`).
# Required: the model tag the server should use (for FastFlowLM, `flm list` shows what's available).
OPENAI_MODEL=llama3.2:1b

# Optional. Default: http://localhost:52625/v1 (FastFlowLM's default port).
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:52625/v1

# Optional. Only hosted servers need one; FastFlowLM, Ollama and LM Studio ignore it.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Overrides the default system prompt (see src/lib/env.ts).
# OPENAI_SYSTEM_PROMPT=

# Optional. Send /api/agent/* to the chatkit gateway instead of this app's own engine (dev server only).
# GATEWAY_URL=http://localhost:7788
